  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can demand respect from anyone who needs to listen to you when it comes to matters of life and death. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Request, Coerce or Command an Animal on a creature that can hear you in the midst of combat, even if you can’t normally take the time to do these actions in combat. This bonus increases to +2 against Fiends or if you are able to pull rank, authority or notoriety over them.</span></p>"
